## Spectrogram Style Used in Dashboard

- **Colormap**: `gray_r` (reversed grayscale — dark = high energy, light = low energy)
- **Shading**: `nearest` (discrete block cells, no blurring)
- **Dynamic range**: 45 dB window from 99.9th percentile peak

> [!TIP]
> The grayscale style was selected after exploring 7 different spectrogram representations. It gives the clearest phoneme energy bands without color distraction, making it ideal for publications.
